{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watermelon (with a broken head) Game is a thrilling and exhilarating physics-based puzzle game inspired by polyomino puzzles and the Suika Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/1.\uce90\uc2a4\ucf00\uc774\ub529.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game follows the journey of a head-injured watermelon as it seeks to recover its lost emotions. Each block represents an emotion, and merging identical blocks evolves them into the next stage of emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategically Drop Blocks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud50c\ub9bd\ud68c\uc804\uac78\uae30.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can rotate and flip blocks to strategically drop them into the desired position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\uc544\uc2ac\uc544\uc2ac\uc313\uae302.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although the space is limited, the blocks are made up of straight lines and right angles, allowing you to interlock them, balance, and stack them as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rotate the Watermelon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud68c\uc804\ud574\uc11c_\ube14\ub85d_\uc6c0\uc9c1\uc774\uae30.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can rotate the watermelon to move the blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ube48\ud2c8\ub9cc\ub4e4\uae30_1.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use this to create gaps between blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud754\ub4e4\uc5b4\uc11c_\uc11e\uae30.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also merge the blocks inside the watermelon (though it's not easy!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ubc1b\uc73c\ub824\ub2e4_\uc6d0\ub798\uac70\uae4c\uc9c0_\ub5a8\uc5b4\ud2b8\ub9ac\uae30.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, as you might accidentally drop more blocks out of the container if you're not careful!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540460?t=1741142669","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/57ce4cc101569955aa5429abfefd9bd9c6bcef76/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741142669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/5c8953a0a700b248898e5dc5b7cd136ab83fa0a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741142669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/5c8953a0a700b248898e5dc5b7cd136ab83fa0a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741142669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watermelon (with a broken head) Game is a thrilling and exhilarating physics-based puzzle game inspired by polyomino puzzles and the Suika Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/1.\uce90\uc2a4\ucf00\uc774\ub529.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game follows the journey of a head-injured watermelon as it seeks to recover its lost emotions. Each block represents an emotion, and merging identical blocks evolves them into the next stage of emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategically Drop Blocks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud50c\ub9bd\ud68c\uc804\uac78\uae30.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can rotate and flip blocks to strategically drop them into the desired position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\uc544\uc2ac\uc544\uc2ac\uc313\uae302.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although the space is limited, the blocks are made up of straight lines and right angles, allowing you to interlock them, balance, and stack them as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rotate the Watermelon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud68c\uc804\ud574\uc11c_\ube14\ub85d_\uc6c0\uc9c1\uc774\uae30.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can rotate the watermelon to move the blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ube48\ud2c8\ub9cc\ub4e4\uae30_1.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use this to create gaps between blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ud754\ub4e4\uc5b4\uc11c_\uc11e\uae30.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also merge the blocks inside the watermelon (though it's not easy!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/\ubc1b\uc73c\ub824\ub2e4_\uc6d0\ub798\uac70\uae4c\uc9c0_\ub5a8\uc5b4\ud2b8\ub9ac\uae30.gif?t=1741142669\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, as you might accidentally drop more blocks out of the container if you're not careful!</p>","developers":["10001 & caku"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/8a28fbf774941f0276ecb5687b12e2c7f1cf443c/header.jpg?t=1741142669","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108225,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108225/movie480.mp4?t=1741142667","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108225/movie_max.mp4?t=1741142667"},"name":"main trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108225/14a0ac8c19118a5581f03189e8578c13cbae1676/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741142667","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108225/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741142667","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108225/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741142667"}}],"name":"Watermelon (with a Broken Head) Game","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<stro